@startuml pulso-comunicacao
' Pulso — Diagrama de Comunicação
' Cenário: Registrar transação de despesa
' Versão: 1.0 | Data: 2026-06-09

skinparam linetype ortho

object ":TransactionsPage" as Page
object ":transactionService" as TService
object ":api (Axios)" as Api
object ":authMiddleware" as Auth
object ":transactionController" as Ctrl
object ":transactionService\n(API)" as Svc
object ":transactionRepository" as Repo
object ":Prisma Client" as Prisma
object ":Categoria" as Cat
object ":Transacao" as Tx
object ":NotificacaoService" as Notif

Page --> TService : 1: submeterFormulario(dados)
TService --> Api : 2: POST /transacoes\n+ Bearer JWT
Api --> Auth : 3: validarToken()
Auth --> Ctrl : 4: create(req)
Ctrl --> Svc : 5: criar(usuarioId, payload)
Svc --> Cat : 6: validarCategoria()
Svc --> Svc : 7: validarRecursoCategoria()\n(RN-038..045)
Svc --> Repo : 8: create(transacao)
Repo --> Prisma : 9: transacao.create()
Prisma --> Tx : 10: persistir
Tx --> Repo : 11: entidade
Repo --> Svc : 12: transacao
Svc --> Notif : 13: notificarSeAplicavel()
Notif --> Page : 14: (opcional) alerta
Svc --> Ctrl : 15: resultado
Ctrl --> Api : 16: 201 JSON
Api --> TService : 17: response
TService --> Page : 18: atualizarLista()

note right of Svc
  Regras:
  - valor > 0
  - VT só em Transporte
  - VR só em Alimentação
  - VA em Alimentação/Compras
end note

@enduml
